            <td align="right" style="font:600 11px/1 -apple-system,Segoe UI,Roboto,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;letter-spacing:.04em;"><a href="https://sqwod.life/de/daily/2026-10-19/?utm_source=sqwod-daily&utm_medium=email&utm_campaign=daily-2026-10-19&utm_content=view-online" style="color:#9a9aa1;text-decoration:none;">Im Browser &rarr;</a></td>
